From: Andrew Gunnerson <accounts+github@chiller3.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 20:13:41 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Use zstd install ops

Signed-off-by: Andrew Gunnerson <accounts+github@chiller3.com>
